			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Guide\n\n1. After you discover the [[Discover the Starting Date of the game.canvas|starting date of the game]] and [[Open the Garage Door and unlock the Outer Room.canvas|unlock the Outer Room]], you can draft a room named [[Shelter.canvas|Shelter]]\n2. This room has a time locked safe.\n3. By using the terminal and calculating the date and time one hour from the current time, you can open the safe and find the [[Red Letters.canvas|Red Letter]] number 7 with a red gem.",
